{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54378","headline":"松江亭（题拟） · 王硕","name":"松江亭（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年张翰此归休，鲈脍蓴羹八月秋。\n万顷烟波闲极目，一帆风便不回头。\n洞庭有路通仙室，笠泽无人直下钩。\n自恨宦名身未了，拂衣东去阿谁留？\n（见《百城烟水》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王硕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}